139-        early_stopping (`bool` or `str`, *optional*):
140-            Controls the stopping condition for beam-based methods, like beam-search. It accepts the following values:
141-            `True`, where the generation stops as soon as there are `num_beams` complete candidates; `False`, where an
142:            heuristic is applied and the generation stops when is it very unlikely to find better candidates;
143-            `"never"`, where the beam search procedure only stops when there cannot be better candidates (canonical
144-            beam search algorithm).
145-        max_time (`float`, *optional*):
146-            The maximum amount of time you allow the computation to run for in seconds. generation will still finish
147-            the current pass after allocated time has been passed.
